1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,790
Failure Forensics — Trace AI outputs back to evidence.

2
00:00:03,790 --> 00:00:08,375
No account. A separate visitor workspace. The site owner provides the Groq connection.

3
00:00:08,375 --> 00:00:12,958
Start with an invented invoice. This sample uses no personal or customer data.

4
00:00:12,958 --> 00:00:17,541
Watch extraction, classification and summarization run. Execution is separate from quality.

5
00:00:17,541 --> 00:00:22,541
Follow the dependency graph. See which steps read the source and each other.

6
00:00:22,541 --> 00:00:27,541
Compare the summary with its source. Inspect claims and exact supporting text.

7
00:00:27,541 --> 00:00:33,541
Bad citations stop a confident diagnosis. Invalid quote offsets make the result inconclusive.

8
00:00:33,541 --> 00:00:38,333
Public access, with fair-use limits. No visitor password; sessions and AI calls are bounded.

9
00:00:38,333 --> 00:00:43,333
Try the live public app: https://failure-forensics-pk.vercel.app
